<view class="page">
  <view class="hero card">
    <view class="eyebrow">企业资质预评估 DEMO</view>
    <view class="hero-title">约 1 分钟，了解企业申报准备度</view>
    <view class="hero-desc">先查看虚构企业画像，再只补充当前判断真正缺少的数据。</view>
    <button class="primary-button hero-cta" bindtap="startAssessment">开始预评估</button>
    <view class="privacy-note">全程先体验，不自动登录，不请求手机号授权</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">本 Demo 覆盖四类预评估</view>
  <view wx:for="{{qualifications}}" wx:key="name" class="qualification card">
    <view class="qualification-name">{{item.name}}</view>
    <view class="qualification-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card journey">
    <view class="section-title">三步完成数据准备</view>
    <view class="journey-row"><text class="number">1</text><text>选择并确认 Demo 企业</text></view>
    <view class="journey-row"><text class="number">2</text><text>查看已获取的企业画像</text></view>
    <view class="journey-row"><text class="number">3</text><text>动态补充影响判断的数据</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">本工具仅提供预评估，不构成官方认定、申报意见或补贴承诺。最终以主管部门政策、申报通知及审核结果为准。</view>
</view>
